I've identified the required changes for both issues. Here is the concise and exact description of the code modifications needed:

### 1. Center the "Back to Lead Bucket" link in `/Lead-bucket/Unlock-payment`
**File:** `frontend/src/routes/Lead-bucket.Unlock-payment.tsx`
**Change:** Locate the `Link` element at the end of the `LeadUnlockPaymentPage` component:
```tsx
<Link to="/Lead-bucket" className="partner-simple-link">Back to Lead Bucket</Link>
```
To center it properly, wrap the link in a `div` that has `display: "flex"` and `justifyContent: "center"` (or similar inline styles):
```tsx
<div style={{ display: "flex", justifyContent: "center", marginTop: 24 }}>
  <Link to="/Lead-bucket" className="partner-simple-link">Back to Lead Bucket</Link>
</div>
```

### 2. Hide "Pay to Unlock" and show "Waiting for admin approval" when status is `SCREENSHOT_SENT`
**File:** `frontend/src/routes/Lead-bucket.tsx`
**Changes needed in three places:**

A. Update `canUnlockLead` logic (Lines 159-160):
Change the condition so that it only returns true for `PENDING_PAYMENT` and not `SCREENSHOT_SENT`:
```tsx
// FROM:
if (lead.unlockOrder?.partnerId === currentPartnerId && ["PENDING_PAYMENT", "SCREENSHOT_SENT"].includes(lead.unlockOrder.status)) return true;

// TO:
// Wait for admin approval if SCREENSHOT_SENT (prevent button click)
if (lead.unlockOrder?.partnerId === currentPartnerId && lead.unlockOrder.status === "SCREENSHOT_SENT") return false;
if (lead.unlockOrder?.partnerId === currentPartnerId && lead.unlockOrder.status === "PENDING_PAYMENT") return true;
```

B. Update `getUnlockLabel` logic (Lines 172-173):
Return a customized text for the `SCREENSHOT_SENT` status instead of showing "Pay $x to Unlock".
```tsx
// FROM:
if (lead.unlockOrder?.partnerId === currentPartnerId && ["PENDING_PAYMENT", "SCREENSHOT_SENT"].includes(lead.unlockOrder.status)) return `Pay ${unlockPrice} to Unlock`;

// TO:
if (lead.unlockOrder?.partnerId === currentPartnerId) {
  if (lead.unlockOrder.status === "SCREENSHOT_SENT") return "Waiting for admin approval";
  if (lead.unlockOrder.status === "PENDING_PAYMENT") return `Pay ${unlockPrice} to Unlock`;
}
```

C. Update `handleUnlock` existing intent check (Line 207):
Make sure it doesn't allow bypassing if somehow clicked when `SCREENSHOT_SENT`.
```tsx
// FROM:
const existingIntent = lead.unlockOrder?.partnerId === currentPartnerId && ["PENDING_PAYMENT", "SCREENSHOT_SENT"].includes(lead.unlockOrder.status)
  ? lead.unlockOrder
  : null;

// TO:
const existingIntent = lead.unlockOrder?.partnerId === currentPartnerId && lead.unlockOrder.status === "PENDING_PAYMENT"
  ? lead.unlockOrder
  : null;
```

These specific adjustments will correctly center the back link and fix the state and button label when the partner has already uploaded a screenshot.

